# Dead registry sidecars still regenerated by Agent/scripts/export-registry.mjs.
# No consumer in this repo since square-mode dropped the <script> tag; the
# calendar uses BAKED_REGISTRY + Supabase runtime fetch instead. Drop these
# entries once export-registry is removed from the Agent pipeline DAG.
